+ *
+ * The window is drawn from the skin's GEN.BMP (Winamp's frame for extra windows,
+ * as used by its Media Library), with the playlist colours and font. All server
+ * work is done by the "navidrome" general plugin; this file only talks to it
+ * through aud_plugin_send_message() and listens for its hooks.
+ */
